    - :func:`jax.numpy.put`: put elements into an array at numerical indices.
    - :func:`jax.numpy.ndarray.at`: array updates using NumPy-style indexing

  Examples:
    >>> x = jnp.zeros((3, 5), dtype=int)
    >>> mask = (jnp.arange(x.size) % 3 == 0).reshape(x.shape)
    >>> mask
